        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "rLqZa",
          "x": 1629,
          "y": 39,
          "name": "Settings help — power limit",
          "context": "Settings help: full description, single unwrapped horizontal marquee. Appearance follows the existing setting screens: 3px category-color rail, 11px left text alignment and 8px right inset. The 24px-tall text line is vertically centered on the 80px display. Existing Space Grotesk 19px semibold settings-value font, existing foreground and category colors; no added raster font sizes. Text viewport is 141px wide. Scroll messages wider than the viewport using the existing DescriptionScrollSpeed, reading pauses and loop behavior; fitting messages are horizontally centered and remain still. Keep existing help activation and button handling unchanged. No heading, footer, indicators, word wrapping or pagination. Use rendered text width for proportional-font marquee calculations. Canvas shows the initial pause; clipping within the marquee is intentional. Firmware unchanged.",
          "reusable": true,
          "clip": true,
          "width": 160,
          "height": 80,
          "fill": "$section-advanced-background",
          "layout": "none",
